OL,3,AMen charged with trespass at Prince and
OL,4,APrincess of Wales's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe men were held in custody and are
OL,7,Fdue to appear at Norwich Magistrates'
OL,8,FCourt this morning, police said.
